        "created_at": "2018-10-03T16:08:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If BODAN pays for an effect that would cause damage, does it do damage? The effect becomes a spirit effect if the player pays anything for it, so I was just wondering if the no damage rule applied. Thanks in advance.</p>",
