        "created_at": "2018-10-03T16:34:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I assume you’re talking about effects from Fear or Event cards.</p>\n<p>Yes, Bringer paying energy can cause damage to be done in this case. I’ve updated the <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5ka92\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">relevant FAQ</a> to be clearer about this. (The special rule specifically refers to Powers.)</p>",
